From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 11:28:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/12] Port step 8: Gorm's yard (even/odd days, horseshoe,
 taboo words, dice for a question, big laundry, big fight bet)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Yard of Gorm now has its own mechanics on top of the existing odd/even gate:
- calendar on the wall states the day honestly (uses scene day, not world day)
- horseshoe: right hand +1 Gorm, left hand -1 Brotherhood and "Gorm sees"; each once per game
- taboo words: Branka teaches them for help with laundry; "last time" promise costs Brotherhood, "I'll come when you call" gives Gorm +1; one promise per visit
- dice for a question (fair coin from world seed): win gives Brenn's word and topic, lose means Gorm learns whose son you are; no money at stake
- even days: judge the children's fight (Branka +1); day 10: big laundry; Branka names the fallen once she likes you
- Nim sells the false "Gorm is ill" rumour for 2 gr.; day 25 big fight bet 5 gr. (win +10)
- visit counters and a journal line for even-day visits
- new test Port/тест/двор.mjs

