 price by outfit, lies weaken the cure)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Healer's visit is now a three-step exam in the scene (engine/приём.js, data/лекарь.js):
- exam: Vorn names one or two facts read from the hero's real state (wound, pain, hunger, habits, tension, sleep, craft marks), scar as the fallback
- three questions, the first always an unimportant one; answering truthfully halves the price, silence pays full and gets an accurate cure, a lie is not challenged but weakens the cure (+1 instead of +2, wound only eased, pain stays)
- price follows the outfit (rags 6 ... merchant coat 12), Vorn's own tincture 4 gr (weaker), notebook counts what Vorn knows about you
- assisting patients gives rany_boytsov and confirms seraya_radost; jar of shards, notebook, Mila's tally, calendar without a date
- new draft topic lekar_zapisi; test Port/тест/лекарь.mjs

